  <data name="txtMessage.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;p&gt;
                    &lt;b&gt;Action Needed!&lt;/b&gt;
                &lt;/p&gt;
                &lt;p&gt;
                    Per the communications you would have recently received regarding the upcoming merchant processor 
                    conversion, please set up your new FirstView Merchant Portal account for access to your transaction activity, and PCI DDS compliance validation, as well as online merchant statements.  Please access FirstView for all reporting beginning 11/1/23.  Historical data will be available in Merchant Intel until 01/26/2024 for downloading. If you have already set-up your FirstView access, please disregard the New User instructions listed below. 
                &lt;/p&gt;
                &lt;p&gt;
                    Visit https://www.firstview.net and select “New Account”
                &lt;/p&gt;

                In the New User Section enter the following:&lt;br&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;New Merchant ID Number (MID) recently received via mail and/or email.  (If you are unsure of your new MID please contact Merchant Support)&lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;Full TIN (Tax Identification Number)&lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;Zip Code&lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
                &lt;p&gt;
                    You will then be prompted to set up your new password.
                &lt;br&gt;
                    We suggest that you bookmark the FirstView site for future use.  If you need any assistance, please contact Merchant Support at 1.888.849.6012, Mon. – Fri., 8am – 5pm.
                &lt;/p&gt;</value>
